reference "sec:Fixedpt"

\end_inset

.
 Definisikan barisan baru 
\begin_inset Formula $\langle a_{n}\rangle$
\end_inset

 dengan
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
a_{n}=c_{n}-\frac{(c_{n+1}-c_{n})^{2}}{c_{n+2}-2c_{n+1}+c_{n}}.
\]

\end_inset

